This RustPy example adapts the Solarized palette to RustPy's editor scheme
format and includes RustPy Python live templates. The revision above pins
the license checked for this notice; it does not establish the revision or
source file used for the historical palette import. That import provenance
is not recorded here. The palette has not been changed by this notice update.
